  "title": "Overnight French Toast Casserole",
  "description": "Instead of flipping French toast two pieces at a time, try this overnight French toast casserole--prepare it at night and just wake up and pop it in the oven in the morning.",
  "authors": [
    "Tina Young"
  ],
